INSERT INTO `blogs` VALUES (8,'How to use Pub Recruiter (Brands)','How-to-use-Pub-Recruiter--Brands-','uploads/blog/EzEBbg1JOIynnU46lvKOm274TWrHWU6Ma6dF0ELV.png','Affiliate program managers can take advantage of Pub Recruiters to recruit more partners!','<div class=\"c-post__head\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; height: 117px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Muli, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><h1 class=\"c-post__title\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 32px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 50px; position: relative; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(0px);\"><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\">Singular place to organize recruitment efforts</span><br></h1></div><div class=\"c-content\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 32px;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We recognize that the Affiliate channel has dozens of agencies and networks.&nbsp; That’s why a singular solution like Pub Recruiter is such a helpful solution for your agency.&nbsp; No more guesswork using decade old Affiliate contact data in the networks!&nbsp; Simply hit the “Request Partnership” button and your potential partner will be notified that you are interested in working together!&nbsp; You can also save the profile using the&nbsp;<img draggable=\"false\" role=\"img\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\"❤️\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/14.0.0/svg/2764.svg\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; max-width: 100%; font-style: italic; border-width: initial !important; border-color: initial !important; border-image: initial !important; display: inline !important; height: 1em !important; box-shadow: none !important; width: 1em !important; margin: 0px 0.07em !important; vertical-align: -0.1em !important; background: none !important; padding: 0px !important;\">&nbsp;icon on the top right corner.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"marketplace 1.png\" style=\"width: 818px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 40px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 700; line-height: initial;\">Fill your placement budget seamlessly!</h3><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Knowing what you pay for is ideal but not always a given.&nbsp; With our profiles, you know what each placement opportunity will cost before a days long approach to finding out.&nbsp; (we even have the ability to show you media kits!</p><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"media kit 1.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"></p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 40px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 700; line-height: initial;\">Outbound Insertion Order Organizer</h3><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Program managers can now take a sigh of relief as they do not have to worry about countless cloud services and cadence revolving around insertion order organization.&nbsp; With our outbound tracker, you can track every partnership request down to the insertion order date</p><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"outbound.png\" style=\"width: 1554px;\"><br></p><h3 style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 40px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 700; line-height: initial;\">Are you an agency? Here\'s how you should be using our software.</h3><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 40px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; line-height: initial;\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Montserrat, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Agencies can certainly use Pub Recruiter as an important piece of their day-to-day&nbsp;recruitment.&nbsp; While it is not recommended you sign up representing your agency as a whole, you can sign up each brand you represent and keep track of recruitment this way.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p></div>',',Pub Recruiter Instructions,','2023-01-12 20:44:04','2024-01-30 23:45:38'),(14,'What is Cashback?','What-is-Cashback-','uploads/blog/7RMQw6h1UdroFcgwvXihl52zsofNdFhYE7XcU2pM.png','Plus find an amazing tool to help research cashback rates!','<p>If you\'ve been interested in saving money, or finding ways to earn back\r\nmoney you\'ve probably come across the incentive program: <b><i>cashback</i></b><o:p></o:p></p><p>Cashback is a pretty simple concept:&nbsp; spend a certain amount on a\r\nproduct or service and get a certain amount of what you spent, back into your\r\naccount.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p>Whether it\'s a cashback website like Rakuten, Mr Rebates, or TopCashback\r\ntheir goal is to promote a certain amount of money you get back after you’ve\r\nsuccessfully purchased a product you were interested in.<o:p></o:p></p><p>The credit card space is also one of incredible competition to win your\r\napplication and has multiple cashback credit cards.&nbsp; Cards offering cashback\r\nare one surefire way to peak many people\'s interest.&nbsp; We love the American\r\nExpress Blue Card Preferred because you get 6% cashback on groceries (an\r\neveryday purchase).&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p>Other credit cards are offering cashback for streaming services and dining\r\nout.&nbsp; Pick a card that works for you and get the maximum amount of\r\ncashback.<o:p></o:p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Affiliate Marketing and Cashback<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>Make no mistake, without Affiliate marketing, the cashback industry would be\r\na lot smaller than what it is today.&nbsp;\r\nWhy?<o:p></o:p></p><p>Affiliate tracking, or those links you use when you click on something\r\nwithin Rakuten or TopCashback operates using this method and these businesses\r\ncan then trace back <b>who</b> on their site made the purchase.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p>The cashback website would make a commission and then give a portion of it\r\nback to the consumer.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p>Here are some noteworthy business acquisitions within the cashback realm\r\nthat you may want to see:<o:p></o:p></p><ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2014/09/09/rakuten-buys-ebates-for-1-billion/\">Rakuten\r\n     buys Ebates for a cool $1 Billion</a><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TopCashback\">TopCashBack earns a\r\n     pre-tax profit of $10 million in 2019</a><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><a href=\"https://www.ecommercenext.org/french-cashback-company-igraal-acquired-by-global-savings-group/\">French\r\n     cashback site gets acquired for $123.5 million</a><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><a href=\"https://performancein.com/news/2019/06/20/capital-one-acquires-luxury-cashback-site-jewel/\">Capital\r\n     One purchases Jewel for an undisclosed amount</a><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n</ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:107%\">The Cashback\r\nMonitor<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%\">Most people\r\nare unaware of a website where you can actually track and compare cashback\r\nrates amongst these large websites (Rakuten, Topcashback, etc).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%\">CashbackMonitor\r\nis a website that helps users find the best cashback deals available for their\r\nonline purchases. It aggregates information from various cashback websites and\r\ndisplays the rates offered by each one, allowing users to compare and choose\r\nthe best option.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"cashbackm.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%\">Cashback\r\nwebsites partner with online retailers to offer customers a percentage of their\r\npurchase amount back in the form of cashback. By using CashbackMonitor, users\r\ncan easily find the highest cashback rates available for a particular retailer\r\nor category of products.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%\">In addition\r\nto cashback rates, CashbackMonitor also provides information about the payout\r\noptions and redemption requirements for each cashback website. This helps users\r\nmake informed decisions about which website to use and how to maximize their\r\ncashback earnings.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%\">As a consumer\r\nor as an Affiliate marketer, you can compare the rates in which you want to\r\nstrategize your loyalty or cashback efforts!<o:p></o:p></span></p>',',Cashback and Loyalty,','2023-03-14 18:48:25','2023-03-14 19:10:11'),(20,'Referral Program vs. Affiliate Program: What\'s the Difference?','Referral-Program-vs--Affiliate-Program--What-s-the-Difference-','uploads/blog/OB5pWlWuXo1OJMMgNJzCu6lebL4rvh7UhAjARXMD.png','Referral Programs ≠ Affiliate Programs','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Referral programs and affiliate\r\nprograms are both popular marketing strategies used by businesses to increase\r\nsales and drive traffic to their websites. While they may seem similar at first\r\nglance, there are some key differences between the two. In this blog post,\r\nwe\'ll explore the differences between referral programs and affiliate programs\r\nand help you decide which one is right for your business.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Referral\r\nPrograms<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">A referral program is a marketing\r\nstrategy that encourages existing customers to refer their friends and family\r\nto a business. In exchange for referring a new customer, the existing customer\r\nmay be rewarded with a discount, credit, or other incentive. Referral programs\r\nare often used by businesses that rely on word-of-mouth marketing, such as online\r\nretailers, subscription services, and service providers.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The benefits of a referral program\r\ninclude:<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Increased customer loyalty: By rewarding existing\r\n     customers for referring new business, you can increase customer loyalty\r\n     and encourage repeat purchases.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Cost-effective: Referral programs are often less\r\n     expensive than other marketing strategies, such as advertising or paid\r\n     search.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Higher conversion rates: Referrals are more likely to\r\n     convert into customers than other types of leads, as they come from a\r\n     trusted source.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Affiliate\r\nPrograms<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">An affiliate program is a marketing\r\nstrategy that involves partnering with other businesses or individuals to\r\npromote your products or services. Affiliates are typically paid a commission\r\nfor each sale or lead they generate. Affiliate programs are often used by\r\nbusinesses that sell physical products, digital products, or services.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">The benefits of an affiliate program\r\ninclude:<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Increased brand exposure: By partnering with\r\n     affiliates, you can reach new audiences and increase brand exposure.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Cost-effective: Like referral programs, affiliate\r\n     programs can be less expensive than other marketing strategies.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Scalable: Affiliate programs can be scaled up or down\r\n     depending on your business\'s needs.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Key\r\nDifferences<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">While referral programs and\r\naffiliate programs have some similarities, there are a few key differences to\r\nkeep in mind:<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Referral programs are focused on rewarding existing\r\n     customers for referring new business, while affiliate programs are focused\r\n     on partnering with other businesses or individuals to promote your\r\n     products or services.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Referral programs are typically more personal and rely\r\n     on relationships between existing customers and their friends or family\r\n     members, while affiliate programs are more transactional and rely on\r\n     relationships between businesses or individuals.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Referral programs are often used by businesses that\r\n     rely on word-of-mouth marketing, while affiliate programs are often used\r\n     by businesses that sell products or services online.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Conclusion<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Both referral programs and affiliate\r\nprograms can be effective marketing strategies for businesses of all sizes. The\r\nkey is to choose the strategy that best fits your business\'s needs and goals.\r\nIf you\'re looking to increase customer loyalty and encourage word-of-mouth\r\nmarketing, a referral program may be the way to go. If you\'re looking to reach\r\nnew audiences and increase brand exposure, an affiliate program may be the\r\nbetter choice. Ultimately, the decision is up to you.</span></p>',',Affiliate Education,','2023-06-21 00:06:06','2023-06-21 00:07:52'),(23,'What are Bounty Tips?','What-are-Bounty-Tips-','uploads/blog/pgvwhNNXZvhX9gvwbkFIuMtyrvQlapbONJoJ0HyX.png','If you are working with us without data integration, here\'s a note about our tip system.','<p>At Pub Recruiter, we want to help you find new Affiliates.&nbsp; So, whenever a brand partner of ours does not have the full capability to utilize data integration, we allow them to work with us on a manual basis.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Recommendations are given to each brand partner should Pub Recruiter\'s own service, find applicable partners for them.&nbsp; In this case, if we find Affiliate partners that could be of use, we would ask for a \"tip\" just to ensure we are rewarded.&nbsp; This helps grow our platform and hopefully bring business to each brand partner who chooses this route.</p><p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"Screenshot 2024-01-29 140247.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"></p><p><b>Tip Chart</b></p><ol><li><i>Affiliate information like contact information; <font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">we recommend a $25 tip</font></i></li><li><i>If the Affiliate ends up responding&nbsp;to your inquiry, whether it is an email based on the information we provided; <font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">we recommend a $40 tip</font></i></li><li><i>If the Affiliate ends up producing sales revenue $5 or more; <font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">we recommend a $200 tip</font></i></li><li><i>If the Affiliate&nbsp;ends up producing sales revenue of $10,000 or more, <font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">we recommend a $1000 tip</font></i></li></ol><p><b>How do we come up with these numbers?</b></p><p>We know that Affiliates are important in driving <b><i>new&nbsp;sales </i></b>and revenue for your brand.&nbsp; Think of Affiliates as a voice for a brand, similar to that of a salesperson that primarily acts on commission only.&nbsp; Having as many chances as possible for increased sales is a unique opportunity that no other channel can provide like the Affiliate channel.&nbsp; Affiliate partners can end up being a sales driver for not only months, but years!&nbsp; Most Affiliates end up driving little performance, but to those who do offer a high value, we feel our tip system is fair to say the least.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',',Pub Recruiter Instructions,','2024-01-30 23:41:10','2024-01-30 23:52:45');
